WEBVTT

00:08:27.163 --> 00:08:31.297
and you develop antibodies that kill
anything that looks differently.

00:08:31.597 --> 00:08:34.097
And even though they perform
innovation activities,

00:08:34.463 --> 00:08:36.597
most of it is innovation theater.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:42.197
Now, I don't believe that companies
have a talent problem.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:46.697
There's great entrepreneurial talent in
companies. There's a ton of ideas.

00:08:46.697 --> 00:08:51.063
That's not the problem. What
we really need is to refuse

00:08:51.063 --> 00:08:53.063
an entrepreneurial spirit.

00:08:53.397 --> 00:08:59.863
We need to use these tools and processes
of disruption in innovation and create